  "actualChanges": [
    "Existing preview context now durably stores original TOC metadata via bounded exact source/book/task TOC lease. Only discovering TOC tasks may CAS metadata; content can read it for original next-chapter lookup. It does not grant App body/UUID/generation authority.",
    "A read-only current preview projection lets preview transfer preserve actual content callback state without refetching and mutating original TOC metadata.",
    "Successful JVM envelopes preserve bounded original Host MayCommit/Committed names. Swift execute parses errors before deciding cancellation, typed DTO conversion retains receipt facts, and per-invocation App observers preserve receipts across close/final metadata publication errors. No effects are inferred solely from DTO success.",
    "Three native-reader fixtures invoke actual default service/runtime/JNI/Host/BookStore/cache, controlled finite NW HTTP peer, original CSS/XPath/JSON/regex, two-page TOC/content, same Cookie and durable variables, actual index/UUID generations and cache restart readback, and cancel/drain with retained real saved prefix."
  ],
